## Data Flow

```
timewarp .npz ──→ dataset.py ──→ (pos_t, vel_t, pos_tp1, vel_tp1, z, edges)
                                          │
                                          ▼
                                     model.py (EGNN)
                                    FiLM(h, z) → K × EGNNLayer
                                          │
                                          ▼
                                   (Δpos, Δvel) residuals
                                          │
                              ┌───────────┴───────────┐
                              ▼                       ▼
                         losses.py                rollout.py
                    (L_pos + L_vel +          (autoregressive
                     L_cons + L_bond)          1000-step inference)
                              │                       │
                              ▼                       ▼
                         train.py              evaluate.py
                    (curriculum +          (Ramachandran + KL
                     scheduled sampling)    + MAD metrics)
```

## How to Run

```bash
# Step 1: Cache Stage-1 graph embeddings (run once)
python -m temporal_dynamics.adapter

# Step 2: Train the EGNN
python -m temporal_dynamics.train

# Step 3: Evaluate on test set
python -m temporal_dynamics.evaluate
```
